{"id":"vod_md_5718","vodId":"5718","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"鸭乃桥论的禁忌推理","name_cn":"鸭乃桥论的禁忌推理","date":"2023-01-01","year":"2023","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第13集","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231102-1/089155d6c0dd7363c105511a274b700a.jpg"},"summary":"世界最顶尖的侦探学校“青蓝（BLUE）”，曾经有一位前途无量的稀世天才，那就是被称为青蓝创办以来最富天资之人——鸭乃桥论。而他却因为校内的某个事件，患上了作为侦探的致命“缺陷”，被逐出青蓝，并被禁止从事侦探工作。其后的五年，论一直在失意与百无聊赖中度日。直到有一天，警视厅搜查一课的刑警·一色都都丸前来请他协助侦破连环杀人案，论停止的时间再次开始流动。一色都都丸知晓论的烦恼，热心地提出协助他，是个“单纯的傻瓜”。论称呼都都丸为“都都”，感觉与他的合作蕴藏着无限的可能性，便任命都都为自己的助手。这对略有隐情且反差巨大的侦探搭档，将一个又一个神秘案件华丽地侦破……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-12-26 01:10:38","episodeCount":13,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231031/tJnqmNLN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231031/x2T4IZGp/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231031/YKra2tII/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231031/ijPYWois/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231031/b7RDsuBP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231111/VQVf5UlI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231113/ucsHtcMe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231121/dreYQnj7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231127/tfg8CmH1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231204/DmD66hYQ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231211/6AoqM4dl/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231219/76jBjO2R/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231225/xX20KTJe/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T08:56:35.653Z"}